  "notes": "## 0.4.0-alpha.8 - 2026-04-09\n\n### Fixes\n\n- You can retry installing an app update after a failed download instead of getting stuck.\n- Settings now shows a clear \"Checking...\" state while update detection is running.\n- Keyboard zoom shortcuts now follow the same zoom levels as the Settings scale controls, so shortcut zoom stays in sync with the selected scale.\n- Fixed a sync issue where copying new content right after receiving synced clipboard content could be skipped.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.4.0-alpha.8 - 2026-04-09\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 更新下载失败后，现在可以直接重试安装，不会卡住。\n- 在设置页检查更新时会显示“正在检查...”，便于确认当前状态。\n- 键盘缩放快捷键现在与设置页缩放档位保持一致，快捷键操作后缩放选择不会错位。\n- 修复一个同步问题：在接收同步剪贴板内容后立刻复制新内容，偶发不会继续同步。",
